// EASCape: Rum Deal's zombie swabs (Void ZombieSwab.kt: each swab attacks on sight until you have
// intimidated it, and none do once Captain Donnie has his 'rum'). The cowardly hunt (Void's
// zombie_pirate hunt range) with the swab's own deal_multi_pirate_a-f bit (deal_var bits 20-25)
// still clear. Donnie's 'rum' sets all six bits (Void advanceSwabVarbits).

[deal_swab_a]
type=player
check_vis=lineofsight
check_nottoostrong=outside_wilderness
check_notcombat=%lastcombat
check_notcombat_self=%npc_lastcombat
check_notbusy=off
extracheck_var=%deal_var,&1048576
find_keephunting=off
find_newmode=opplayer2

